{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792807380, "covers_from": "2026-10-24T02:03:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-24T02:04:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792807440, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-24T02:03:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36610, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "觀光", "content": "我們的觀光景點周圍的配套大部分都不太夠，比如走完這個景點，周圍就沒有什麼好逛的，不夠有整體規劃", "display_name": "士林代表 No.36,610", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T02:03:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3523, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "我覺得環境整潔是基本的，文山區內的人行道跟本雜草叢生，也沒有看到有人在清除整理，跟本生態步道", "display_name": "文山代表 No.3,523", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T02:03:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 26475, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "在台北市，常常拿著垃圾，走了一個小時，找不到一個垃圾桶。能給我一個有垃圾桶的城市嗎？", "display_name": "中山代表 黃世丞🍊心想事成", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-24T02:03:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 70366, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你擔任市長，勞工退休金（純舊制）會不會依據勞基法辦理？\n如果不會，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.70,366", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 3523, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.3,523", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 26475, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 黃世丞🍊心想事成", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 70366, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.70,366", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 42754, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "disp